commit 927b4f39dde4e5b034bffed237f2732f15265fee
Author: Jack Shelton <me@jackshelton.com>
Date:   Tue Aug 11 04:32:09 2026 -0500

    feat: real pointer drag primitive, rendered-style probes, drag-surface closed list

    drag(from,to,steps) interpolates past the CDK tracking threshold with
    viewport-clamped drop; renderedStyles(probes) measures styling claims
    from the live page. angular-jira-clone joins WITNESS_REAL_APP_NAMES;
    'drag' joins WitnessGesture gated by a closed WITNESS_REAL_APP_DRAG_SURFACES
    list — drag remains a hard failure everywhere else. Browser-proven
    en route: drag settles Akita state, the NZ_MODAL_DATA rewrite delivers
    on both lanes, the 550KB style aggregate shows no rendered difference
    across seven probes. 1131/1131.

